<v Speaker 2>So, wallahi, I give myself first of all this advice and I give you all the sincere advice that be humble in all walks of life.

321
00:46:35.370 --> 00:46:36.650
<v Speaker 2>You know, don't be arrogant.

322
00:46:38.090 --> 00:46:40.730
<v Speaker 2>Not about our religion, not about anything.

323
00:46:41.290 --> 00:46:46.330
<v Speaker 2>It is the greatest challenge that we all face in our times today because arrogance

324
00:46:46.890 --> 00:46:49.610
<v Speaker 2>is the adhan, it is the call of our times today.

325
00:46:50.330 --> 00:46:53.450
<v Speaker 2>It has become the trademark of success in this world today.

326
00:46:53.690 --> 00:46:58.490
<v Speaker 2>Schools, colleges, work, families, communities, it's all about I'm better than you.

327
00:47:01.530 --> 00:47:05.130
<v Speaker 2>And arrogance does not befit a slave.

328
00:47:05.690 --> 00:47:07.730
<v Speaker 2>It does not befit an obedient slave.

329
00:47:08.090 --> 00:47:13.250
<v Speaker 2>So may Allah grant us all humility and guide us and enable us in walking in the.

330
00:47:13.250 --> 00:47:16.330
<v Speaker 1>Footsteps of our beloved prophet sallallahu alaihi wasallam
